    description: "S\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111\u1EA5t n\u1EC7n k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p s\xE0n c\xE1t Ssireum h\u1EEFu ngh\u1ECB gi\u1EEFa h\u1ED9i l\xE0ng Vi\u1EC7t - H\xE0n."
    mapSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e801, type: 3}
    thumbnailSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e802, type: 3}
    arenaRadius: 3.65
  - mapName: "2. S\u01A1n C\u1EA3nh K\u1EF3 Quan (Y\xEAn T\u1EED - Seoraksan)"
    description: "S\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5u b\u1ED3ng b\u1EC1nh gi\u1EEFa m\xE2y ng\xE0n v\xE0 \u0111\u1EC9nh n\xFAi thi\xEAng li\xEAng, gi\xF3 l\u1ED9ng th\u1EED th\xE1ch b\u1EA3n l\u0129nh."
